{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121517","id":4079836086,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7zLVu2","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121517","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121517.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121517.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121517","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121517/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121517/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121517/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7b2b00d1d4bcc6fd3ed2e337a6b641fd6af96c8f","number":121517,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Editor: Add Multiple Project Directories","user":{"login":"unit-tick","id":267148939,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-xeiw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267148939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick","html_url":"https://github.com/unit-tick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nAdds the option to add and select from multiple project directories, allowing for better organisation of projects without flooding a single list.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/577a9ef4-c1bd-4f94-8b7f-c0bc9137a7c9\r\n\r\nOnly the projects in the selected directory is shown.\r\n\r\nCloses [#3560](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3560)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- Scan: Only scans the folder of the currently selected directory. If no directories have been added, opens the dialog and will add the selected folder.\r\n- Import: Only imports the project to the currently selected directory.\r\n- Install and Create: Can choose any directory. If the chosen path is not in the list, it is added (along with any projects in the path)\r\n\r\nSome other details:\r\n\r\n- Editor Setting: Will be off by default, on in this PR for easier testing.\r\n- ConfigFile: Uses a separate configfile from `projects.cfg` as the organisation of the directories and their contents require a different format.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.gith